What changed from upstream:
- One question at a time instead of rounds; "batch" brings back a whole round on request.
- A grounding step: the team's OKF v0.2 knowledge through the consult skill, a file, or an idea.
- Plans are challenged against existing decisions, with citations.
- An optional OKF v0.2 draft is written at the end, on request.
- Upstream sets `disable-model-invocation: true` (user-invoked only). This version can also be
  triggered by its description ("grill me about ...").
